{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The teleportation to the flying island of Alba didn't go as planned. You regain consciousness almost naked and without equipment, with memory gaps after the failed transfer. Your partner Dorian, who managed to materialize with all his gear, doesn't miss a chance to mock you about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission seems simple: find a fragment of an ancient artifact. The problem is that the island is divided between warring factions, and the path to the abandoned city in the north is blocked by a local witch's magical barrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven adult RPG with a choice system that affects character relationships.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Lirn is engulfed in war between the Order and the forces of Destruction. Both sides are hunting for an ancient artifact of incredible power, capable of altering reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inhabitants are forced to survive as best they can under these conditions. Besides the war, the wild territories are full of dangers: goblins, wolves, trolls, and other creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong><br>The main story mode. Explore the island of Alba, complete quests, battle enemies, and learn more about the characters. Your choices affect relationships and unlock various story developments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harem Mode</strong><br>Free access to all explicit scenes with characters you've unlocked in story mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains explicit sexual content, nudity, scenes of violence and blood. </strong><br><strong>For ages 18+ only. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Immerse yourself in the world of Lirn, where your decisions determine destinies, your words charm, and your passion burns hearts to ashes. Become a hero worthy of uncovering the world's greatest secret.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1636460?t=1771182755","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1636460?t=1771182755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636460/47c0999408e328f32d037217e2aadbd361759f8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771182755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636460/47c0999408e328f32d037217e2aadbd361759f8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771182755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is an adult game and includes strong language, frequent nudity and strong sexual content.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The teleportation to the flying island of Alba didn't go as planned. You regain consciousness almost naked and without equipment, with memory gaps after the failed transfer. Your partner Dorian, who managed to materialize with all his gear, doesn't miss a chance to mock you about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission seems simple: find a fragment of an ancient artifact. The problem is that the island is divided between warring factions, and the path to the abandoned city in the north is blocked by a local witch's magical barrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven adult RPG with a choice system that affects character relationships.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Lirn is engulfed in war between the Order and the forces of Destruction. Both sides are hunting for an ancient artifact of incredible power, capable of altering reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inh